          "Stop customer refund exception preparation when identity, scope, source, version, authority, destination, required evidence, or owner is absent or conflicting. Also stop when the request would broaden access, alter protected content, create a promise, move money, affect employment, publish externally, bypass safety, or make another protected decision. Each stop needs a lane-specific reason code, protected evidence pointer, named owner, backup, response window, safe interim state, and resumption condition. A correct stop is a control success even if elapsed time grows. When an override is authorized, record its owner, reason, exact scope, affected records, compensating safeguard, expiry, and later review rather than letting it become silent precedent. For Route Employee Directory Corrections Without Changing HR Policy, checkpoint 7 is replayed against the named source, current procedure, adverse-case evidence, accountable-owner disposition, and accepted destination before the record advances."
